# Example Ollama Modelfile for AI Engineering Cockpit (Mac hybrid mode only).
#
# Builds a lightly customized llama3 variant with a system prompt tuned for
# this repo's examples. Windows users can ignore this file entirely — see
# docs/WINDOWS_VS_MAC.md for why.
#
# Usage:
#   ollama create cockpit-assistant -f models/ollama/Modelfile
#   ollama run cockpit-assistant
#
# See models/ollama/README.md for the full walkthrough.

FROM llama3

# Keep responses grounded and concise for local dev/test use.
PARAMETER temperature 0.4
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096

SYSTEM """
You are a local development assistant for the AI Engineering Cockpit project.
Answer concisely. When asked for code, prefer Python 3.11+ with type hints
and docstrings. If you don't know something, say so instead of guessing.
"""
